    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "text_intro",
      "value": "Press **Start series** to schedule three series of notifications, each sending one notification a day:\n\n- **Debug Repeat**: 3 notifications, the first 2 min from now.\n- **Debug Repeat End**: starts 3 min from now. Its end date is tomorrow, so it stops after 2 notifications. This shows an end date cutting a series short.\n- **Debug Repeat Reminder**: 3 notifications, each 2 min after a Debug Repeat one. This shows reminders using a delay.\n\nThat's 8 notifications in total. Check them on the /notifications page.",
