    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "text_recalculate",
      "value": "Tests **Recalculate** (the `campaign: recalculate` action), for when a campaign's conditions change but no field does.\n\n1. Press **Activate in 1 min**. The Debug Recalculate campaign becomes active 1 min later.\n2. Campaigns are re-checked when the app starts, when a field they use changes, or after a notification's actions run, but not as time passes.\n3. Press **Recalculate** and check again. Debug Recalculate is now scheduled, at the next 12:00 (the default time, as the schedule doesn't set one).\n\n**Reset** deactivates it and removes the notification.\n\nActive from: @fields.debug_recalculate_from",
      "_translations": {
        "value": {}
      },
      "_nested_name": "text_recalculate",
      "_dynamicFields": {
        "value": [
          {
            "fullExpression": "Tests **Recalculate** (the `campaign: recalculate` action), for when a campaign's conditions change but no field does.\n\n1. Press **Activate in 1 min**. The Debug Recalculate campaign becomes active 1 min later.\n2. Campaigns are re-checked when the app starts, when a field they use changes, or after a notification's actions run, but not as time passes.\n3. Press **Recalculate** and check again. Debug Recalculate is now scheduled, at the next 12:00 (the default time, as the schedule doesn't set one).\n\n**Reset** deactivates it and removes the notification.\n\nActive from: @fields.debug_recalculate_from",
